    "feesApplyText": "Tenant charges are as set out in the Information for Tenant guide. Once you have decided to put forward an offer to let a property you are required to read and acknowledge Tenant guide and pay a holding deposit.<br /><br /><b>Lettings Fee Information for Assured Periodic Tenancies (APT)</b><br /><br /><b>Summary of Tenant charges for an APT</b><br /><br /><b>Holding Deposit</b><br />1 weeks rent (deducted from the pre move-in invoice)<br />Tenancy Deposit Between 5 or 6 weeks rent<br /><br />Change of Tenant (mid Tenancy)<br />Deed of assignment \u00a350 (inc VAT)<br />Deed of surrender \u00a350 (inc VAT)<br />Deed of variance \u00a350 (inc VAT)<br /><br />Rent is  Pure Rent  and does not include any services such as council tax and utilities. Monthly rent is calculated as follows: \u00a3weekly rental x 52 divided by 12 = monthly rent<br /><br /><b><b>All charges are inclusive of VAT at the prevailing rate.</b><br /><br /><b>Summary of Tenant charges for a Non APT</b><br /><br /><b> Holding Deposit</b><br />2 weeks rent (deducted from the pre move-in invoice)<br /><br /><b> New tenancies</b><br />Tenancy agreement \u00a3480 (inc VAT)<br />Credit references Individual \u00a390 (inc VAT) per application<br />Guarantor \u00a390 (inc VAT) per application<br />Company \u00a3144 (inc VAT) per application<br /><br /><b>Change of Tenant (mid Tenancy)</b><br />Deed of assignment \u00a3275 (inc VAT))<br />Deed of surrender \u00a3170 (inc VAT)<br />Deed of Variance \u00a3170<br />Credit references please refer above<br /><br /><b>Summary of Tenant charges for a Non APT</b><br /><br /><b>Renewal</b><br />Renewal memorandum document \u00a3225 (inc VAT)<br />Renewal Tenancy agreement \u00a3480 (inc VAT)<br /><br /><b>Deposit</b><br />Between 1.5 and 2 month s rent (depending on circumstances)<br />Rent Usually monthly/quarterly/six monthly/annually in advance and subject to negotiation. Rent is  Pure Rent  and does not include any services such as council tax and utilities. Monthly rent is calculated as follows; \u00a3weekly rental x 52 divided by 12 = monthly rent<br /><br /><b>All charges are inclusive of VAT at the prevailing rate.</b><br /><br />Strutt & Parker is a trading style of BNP Paribas Real Estate Advisory & Property Management UK Limited registered in England with company number 04176965 and registered office address 10 Harewood Avenue, London NW1 6AA<br /><br />We are a member of the Royal Institution of Chartered Surveyors ( RICS ) (with membership Number 007555) and subscribe to the RICS Clients Money Protection Scheme. Independent redress is provided by the Property Redress Scheme.<br /></b>",
